-- ==============================================================================
--  WezTerm Configuration — Lua
--  Author: @HKDEVS | Org: @HKDevloops
--  Font:   CaskaydiaCove Nerd Font (primary), Mononoki Nerd Font (fallback)
--  GPU:    WebGpu (Direct3D 11) — 3D rendering, same as Windows Terminal
